OL,7,Fgovernment by the hard-right Sweden
OL,8,FDemocrats (SD), which have neo-Nazi
OL,9,Froots. He has promised cabinet jobs for
OL,10,Fthe SD if he stays in charge.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
